    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d394">

                <pb facs="0727" n="607" sameAs="frus:frus1932v01/pg607"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Finland/40</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Finland
                        (Brodie)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 90</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-05-31">May 31, 1932</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State refers to previous correspondence regarding the
                    President’s Proposal of June 20, 1931, for postponement of intergovernmental
                    debts, and transmits for the information of the American Minister copy of the
                    “Agreement between the Republic of Finland and the United States of America, May
                    23, 1932”.<anchor n="37" xml:id="d394-f1"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
